b.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/48434","id":3012153178,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM6zic9a","user":{"login":"s4iko","id":72751023,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzUxMDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72751023?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko","html_url":"https://github.com/s4iko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-27T08:20:04Z","updated_at":"2025-06-27T08:20:04Z","body":"Hi, sure, here you go.\n[code-with-quarkus-liquibase-native.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20942556/code-with-quarkus-liquibase-native.zip)\n\nTo reproduce:\n```\n# Build the native executable\nmvn install -Dnative -Dquarkus.native.container-build=true\n\n# start the app with JVM\nmvn quarkus:dev\n\n# get and set the port used to expose the Postgres started with the dev services\ndocker ps # get the port of postgres container\nexport DB_PORT=<postgres port>\n\n# run the native executable with options to connect to the same postgres\n./target/code-with-quarkus-1.0.0-SNAPSHOT-runner \\\n  -Dquarkus.datasource.jdbc.url=jdbc:postgresql://localhost:$DB_PORT/quarkus \\\n  -Dquarkus.datasource.username=quarkus \\\n  -Dquarkus.datasource.password=quarkus\n```\n\nthen you should get an error such as:\n```\n...\nCaused by: liquibase.exception.CommandExecutionException: liquibase.exception.ValidationFailedException: Validation Failed:\n     1 changesets check sum\n          db/changeLog.xml::1::quarkus was: 9:11a66c0a11a5b04990fd4356340ee9bd but is now: 9:7bd6b6064602d07b77e3d5fb49ddbae2\n...\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/3012153178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"s4iko","id":72751023,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyNzUxMDIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72751023?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko","html_url":"https://github.com/s4iko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/s4iko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":18352156928,"node_id":"UNLE_lADOCFbutM67_EI8zwAAAARF37EA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/18352156928","actor":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand","html_url":"https://github.com/geoand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://a